From 8d1caec647ecbc6eb068dfdf76710f0db8848946 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
Date: Fri, 06 Nov 2026 23:55:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Start unifying QEMU and K3 trees, make builds reproducible and enable parallel builds

Signed-off-by: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
---
